comment on column organizations.tags is
  'Free tags. research-claude / research-chatgpt: added automatically (trigger organizations_profile_research) from profile.researchedBy; ChatGPT: do not add them by hand, set profile.researchedBy instead. nyc: added and removed automatically (trigger organizations_nyc_tag) when city is in New York City; ChatGPT: do not add it by hand, write the city as "<City>, NY" instead. NYC venues get no booking or fee pitch, so never queue a booking email for them. rental-only: the hall does not present its own concerts (artists rent it); never queue a booking email for these. tour-northwest / tour-midwest: presenters for the 2028-29 regional tours (Pacific Northwest around Smith Fine Arts, Monmouth OR; Upper Midwest around Matinee Musicale, Duluth MN); ChatGPT may add them to presenters within about 6 hours by car of those regions. nyc-under-5h: city at most about 5 hours by car from Midtown Manhattan, never on NYC organizations. chamber-specialist: presents mainly chamber music or recitals. prestigious: places the owner really wants to play; the owner adds or removes it by hand.';
